"electrical tests by a safe method of analyzing analog signatures. All you "
"need to find faults on the test board or chip is the removed volt–ampere "
"characteristics (signatures) of the reference board or chip and our EyePoint "
"P10b system. You will get a high-quality result in a matter of minutes. "

