"512 channels in total). It is used in conjunction with manual signature "
"analyzers of the EyePoint line. <br />Multiplexer EyePoint MUX is designed "
"to switch one input channel to any of the output channels in a sequence "
"specified by the operator. With the help of EyePoint MUX, you can quickly "
"test the edge connectors of faulty boards, as well as perform input control "
"of chips when using specialized equipment for their installation. "

